DOAO6SJc7AJ3sb","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T11:39:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T11:39:23Z","body":"> Clicking the expand icon again doesn't collapse the subresources. We should probably make it do that, so it behaves more like the Tree arrows.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure about that, it would make the button duplicate the arrow's functionality.\r\nAlternative options (not sure which one is the best):\r\n- Make the button disappear when pressed.\r\n- Make the button _remove_ folding, so the sub-resources need to be loaded again. This could deserve a separate icon?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3223812891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224549624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109710#issuecomment-3224549624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109710","i