?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T15:15:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T15:15:31Z","body":"Added sub-resource support to list view:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63969074-071e-4826-b84a-b7afef018dcf\r\n\r\nWith this I think the PR should be ready. There are missing features, but not something that can't be added later.\r\nWhat's still missing:\r\n- Inspecting sub-resources of imported scenes\r\n  - I could implement it in this PR, but I don't know how xd\r\n- Inspecting sub-resources of non-scene Resources\r\n  - This requires some code in format loaders and is going to be rather difficult\r\n- Sub-resource support in EditorFileDialog and QuickOpenDialog\r\n  - I'm not sure if it's useful enough to be worth the trouble tbh\r\n\r\nI guess the question is whether the feature is useful enough in the current state.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4380609020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]